<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-ss-1-norm> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/values/Prohibition>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
