    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Defines a temporal interval for proper disposal of a firearm.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(b) the person does so intending that the firearm will be disposed of in the other State or Territory...";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The person must dispose of the firearm within a certain time frame.";
