    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibits obtaining financial advantage from Commonwealth entity for ineligible person";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(2) A person is guilty of an offence if:  (a) the person obtains a financial advantage for another person from a third person, knowing or believing that the other person is not eligible to receive that financial advantage; and  (b) the third person is a Commonwealth entity.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(2) A person is guilty of an offence if:  (a) the person obtains a financial advantage for another person from a third person, knowing or believing that the other person is not eligible to receive that financial advantage; and  (b) the third person is a Commonwealth entity.";
